WEBVTT

00:00:00.545 --> 00:00:02.183
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> I <b>live</b> in the city centre.

00:00:04.174 --> 00:00:05.321
She <b>doesn’t smoke</b>.

00:00:07.294 --> 00:00:09.131
He’s <b>looking</b> for a new job.

00:00:11.154 --> 00:00:12.494
I’<b>m leaving</b> tomorrow.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:16.567
We <b>saw</b> a good film last night.

00:00:18.545 --> 00:00:20.584
We <b>didn’t do</b> anything yesterday.

00:00:22.591 --> 00:00:24.579
He <b>was working</b> in Paris.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.802
What <b>were</b> you <b>doing</b> at 7.00?

00:00:30.846 --> 00:00:32.914
I<b>’m going to see</b> Tom tonight.

00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:37.111
Look! It<b>’s going to snow</b>.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:40.570
You<b>’ll love</b> New York.

00:00:42.516 --> 00:00:43.796
I<b>’ll phone</b> her later.

00:00:45.766 --> 00:00:46.691
I<b>’ll help</b> you.

00:00:48.753 --> 00:00:50.313
I<b>’ll pay</b> you back tomorrow.

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:53.518
I<b>’ve</b> finished the book.

00:00:55.538 --> 00:00:57.161
<b>Have</b> you <b>ever been</b> to Iran?